    "detailed_description": "<strong>Collect great memories with this artful game experience.</strong><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1419290/extras/8de179dc916306c0219f14991f5bc8a4.poster.avif?t=1678827418\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1419290/extras/8de179dc916306c0219f14991f5bc8a4.webm?t=1678827418\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1419290/extras/8de179dc916306c0219f14991f5bc8a4.mp4?t=1678827418\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br><br><strong>Find and help new friends and yourself.</strong><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1419290/extras/0b09706aac760f0de27e9ea46a3d9515.poster.avif?t=1678827418\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1419290/extras/0b09706aac760f0de27e9ea46a3d9515.webm?t=1678827418\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1419290/extras/0b09706aac760f0de27e9ea46a3d9515.mp4?t=1678827418\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br><br><strong>Journey through this beautiful 2D puzzle platformer.</strong><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1419290/extras/2dc783cf44b34ec6e4cdbbc2257c77ed.poster.avif?t=1678827418\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1419290/extras/2dc783cf44b34ec6e4cdbbc2257c77ed.webm?t=1678827418\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1419290/extras/2dc783cf44b34ec6e4cdbbc2257c77ed.mp4?t=1678827418\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br><br><strong>Explore a unique and unfamiliar painted world with San.</strong><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1419290/extras/b8db0a6135dc3a165eaa3099169d8a97.poster.avif?t=1678827418\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1419290/extras/b8db0a6135dc3a165eaa3099169d8a97.webm?t=1678827418\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1419290/extras/b8db0a6135dc3a165eaa3099169d8a97.mp4?t=1678827418\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div>",
