678827418\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br><br><strong>Explore a unique and unfamiliar painted world with San.</strong><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1419290/extras/b8db0a6135dc3a165eaa3099169d8a97.poster.avif?t=1678827418\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1419290/extras/b8db0a6135dc3a165eaa3099169d8a97.webm?t=1678827418\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1419290/extras/b8db0a6135dc3a165eaa3099169d8a97.mp4?t=1678827418\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div>",
    "short_description": "A unique adventure game filled with beautiful puzzles all hand-drawn in an original 2D style . Out of Line follows the adventures of San in a quest to escape the Factory that was once home. Dive into a story set in a mysterious world that is revealed through multiple chapters.",
    "supported_languages": "English, French, Italian, German, Spanish - Spain, Portuguese - Portugal, Japanese, Korean, Portuguese - Brazil, Simplified Chinese, Traditional Chinese, Polish, Russian",
